        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "近くで雷が落ちた衝撃で、窓ガラスがビリビリと激しく震えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "工事現場の重機が動くたびに、地面からビリビリと振動が伝わってくる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "大型トラックが通り過ぎる際、家の戸がビリビリと音を立てた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "feeling an electric shock",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "低周波治療器を肩に当てると、筋肉がビリビリと刺激されるのを感じる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "痺れた足で無理に立ち上がろうとしたら、ビリビリとした感覚が足先まで広がった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "水に濡れた手でコンセントに触れると、ビリビリと感電する恐れがあり非常に危険だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
